---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const privacySchema = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Privacy Policy - CurrencieConv",
  "url": "https://currencieconv.com/privacy",
  "description": "Privacy Policy for CurrencieConv currency converter. Learn how we handle data privacy, cookies, and user security.",
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "CurrencieConv",
    "url": "https://currencieconv.com"
  }
});
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - CurrencieConv Online Currency Converter"
  description="Read the Privacy Policy for CurrencieConv. We prioritize your privacy with zero personal data collection, no account requirements, and transparent real-time currency conversions."
  keywords="privacy policy, CurrencieConv privacy, data protection, zero tracking currency converter"
  currentPath="/privacy"
  schemaMarkup={privacySchema}
>
  <div class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="container-app max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="mb-10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase font-mono tracking-widest text-link font-semibold">Legal Documentation</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4 text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-mute">Last updated: August 17, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Policy Content -->
      <article class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-body text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        <section class="border-b border-hairline pb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>CurrencieConv</strong> (currencieconv.com), founded and operated by <strong>Anuska Rani</strong>. We are committed to protecting your privacy and providing a safe, transparent online currency conversion experience.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This Privacy Policy explains how CurrencieConv collects, uses, and safeguards information when you visit our website. Because we operate a free, no-login utility service, our fundamental principle is simple: <strong>we collect as little data as possible</strong>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="border-b border-hairline pb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">2. Information We Do NOT Collect</h2>
          <p>Unlike financial institutions or commercial currency exchange brokers, CurrencieConv does not require registration or personal account creation. Therefore, we do NOT collect:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 mt-3 pl-2">
            <li>Your name, physical address, or phone number</li>
            <li>Your email address (unless you voluntarily email our support team)</li>
            <li>Your credit card, bank account, or payment details</li>
            <li>Your financial transaction history or exchange amounts</li>
            <li>Government-issued identification or passport numbers</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="border-b border-hairline pb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">3. Local Data Storage & Preferences</h2>
          <p>
            To enhance your user experience, CurrencieConv uses browser <code>localStorage</code> solely to save your local UI preferences, such as:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 mt-3 pl-2">
            <li>Your selected color theme (Light Mode vs Dark Mode preference)</li>
            <li>Your last selected currency converter pair (e.g., USD to EUR or USD to INR)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This data remains entirely on your personal device and is never transmitted to or stored on our external servers. You can clear this data at any time by clearing your web browser cookies and site storage.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="border-b border-hairline pb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">4. Log Files & Server Performance</h2>
          <p>
            Like virtually all standard web servers, CurrencieConv automatically records standard technical access log entries when pages are requested. These log entries may include your IP address, browser type, operating system, referring pages, date/time stamps, and requested URLs.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We use this information exclusively for server performance monitoring, preventing cyber attacks (such as DDoS), and ensuring fast page load times worldwide. Log files are automatically purged on a regular schedule and are never combined with personal identities.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="border-b border-hairline pb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">5. Cookies & Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>
            CurrencieConv does not use tracking cookies or persistent advertising cookies. We do not sell, rent, or share user data with third-party advertisers or data brokers.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Our currency exchange rates are retrieved from reputable financial market data feeds (such as public interbank API endpoints). These API calls perform server-to-server data fetches to deliver live exchange rates without embedding third-party user tracking scripts.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="border-b border-hairline pb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">6. Security Measures</h2>
          <p>
            We take data security seriously. CurrencieConv uses HTTPS encryption across all pages to ensure that data transferred between your browser and our servers is protected against tampering and eavesdropping.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="border-b border-hairline pb-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">7. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            CurrencieConv is a general audience educational and financial reference tool. We do not knowingly collect or solicit personal information from children under the age of 13.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="pb-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4">8. Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our practices, please contact founder Anuska Rani directly at:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline rounded-lg font-mono text-sm">
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> privacy@currencieconv.com / hello@currencieconv.com</p>
            <p><strong>Website:</strong> currencieconv.com</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
